    "Matching reports do not establish equality of proof bodies, all persistent extensions or other downstream clients. Single shared-load timing pairs are not general benchmarks. The exploratory broad grep was interrupted without retained log.",
    "Compiled objects are excluded; external objects are needed to verify recorded hashes."
